        "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/064ce950ebf5227c48b3eea1dcfe6df5.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sandbox adventure game with RPG progression at its core. Survival pressure is relatively low, giving you the freedom to enslave various alien beasts, craft skills for them, and evolve them into their ultimate forms! You can also explore the underground world, defeat bosses and insectoid swarms, and keep forging stronger weapons and gear as you delve deeper into the alien planet in search of a way back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/1209d01e72281feeb8a5705e44044870.avif?t=1787824588\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore this world filled with alien plants and animals. Start with mining and logging, craft more advanced tools, climb the technology tree, and build and expand your shelter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try taming alien creatures—they can be raised to produce meat or animal products, ridden to travel across the planet, or taken into battle against bosses to become the overlord of this alien world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f0c5d6176c77f81ec4c92577acd1330e.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f0c5d6176c77f81ec4c92577acd1330e.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/f0c5d6176c77f81ec4c92577acd1330e.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/19d8ce67abf815748e08ecd1e0e8b1b3.avif?t=1787824588\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the alien world above, powerful monsters and bosses lurk underground. Defeat them to obtain various weapons, equipment, and materials, which can be crafted into advanced gear to make yourself stronger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7dd5442d4b3d347dd7fc02f598f7e053.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7dd5442d4b3d347dd7fc02f598f7e053.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/7dd5442d4b3d347dd7fc02f598f7e053.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are hundreds of weapons and accessories with distinct combat styles—swords, bows, staves, hammers, and more, each with unique variations. Weapons can be upgraded and enhanced, branching into even more forms. Accessories also grant different attributes and effects, such as sprinting, dashing, or revival, allowing you to freely customize your combat style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/9ec3106ed0b92a89f479149303a4db0a.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/9ec3106ed0b92a89f479149303a4db0a.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/9ec3106ed0b92a89f479149303a4db0a.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/fe4525116cd31811c2f3ed97a145c0b7.avif?t=1787824588\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit or capture scattered minions across the alien world. Whether farming 9-to-9-6 or mining 0-to-0-7, you can command them freely. Assign them to smelt iron, cook meals, or stock goods—the planet’s automation runs on the hard work of your minions. Fully enjoy the life of an alien rancher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/85df4f1eb904a80fae0f4df1c1e0b23c.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/85df4f1eb904a80fae0f4df1c1e0b23c.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/85df4f1eb904a80fae0f4df1c1e0b23c.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the genes of wild creatures and use the bio-lab to create gene chips, transforming your minions into powerful weapons. This not only boosts their stats but can also change their attack patterns. Continuously upgrade and enhance your minions, leading them to conquer the planet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/21308134a0e7223784da1bd12aff286d.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/21308134a0e7223784da1bd12aff286d.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/21308134a0e7223784da1bd12aff286d.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/4ed9e9d6d6b42268638cc66b9b4f704e.avif?t=1787824588\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw materials to crafting to shelving, enjoy a full-cycle service with no middlemen taking a cut. Set up stalls to sell goods, attract merchants lining up to buy, and turn your base into the CBD of the alien world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/24070b122eb8d9e0162aa71609576cd7.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/24070b122eb8d9e0162aa71609576cd7.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/24070b122eb8d9e0162aa71609576cd7.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personally build and run a trending restaurant, create hit dishes like “Boiled Bug Jelly,” offer full entertainment and lodging services, and attract merchants from across the universe—experience life as an interstellar tycoon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/a115c1df3871e6c8503a095239c0bb0f.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/a115c1df3871e6c8503a095239c0bb0f.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/a115c1df3871e6c8503a095239c0bb0f.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sandbox adventure game with RPG progression at its core. Survival pressure is relatively low, giving you the freedom to enslave various alien beasts, craft skills for them, and evolve them into their ultimate forms! You can also explore the underground world, defeat bosses and insectoid swarms, and keep forging stronger weapons and gear as you delve deeper into the alien planet in search of a way back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/1209d01e72281feeb8a5705e44044870.avif?t=1787824588\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore this world filled with alien plants and animals. Start with mining and logging, craft more advanced tools, climb the technology tree, and build and expand your shelter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.poster.avif?t=1787824588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.webm?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461270/extras/73b2f61a32442929399b23e13feebfdf.mp4?t=1787824588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try taming alien creatures—they can be raised to produce meat or animal products, ridden to travel across the planet, or taken into battle against bosses to become the overlord of this alien world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img